  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Crossed Rifle Shemagh Scarves, adaptable to any environment, serve as face masks, balaclavas, or headwraps. Ideal for deserts, snowstorms, or any extreme weather, these tactical military scarves are a must-have for anyone! Made of breathable woven cotton, the printed shemagh protects your head and neck from the sun, snow, and debris. Measuring approximately 42 inches x 42 inches, the scarf can be worn in various ways.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "6286",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Crossed Rifle Shemagh Scarves, adaptable to any environment, serve as face masks, balaclavas, or headwraps. Ideal for deserts, snowstorms, or any extreme weather, these tactical military scarves are a must-have for anyone! Made of breathable woven cotton, the printed shemagh protects your head and neck from the sun, snow, and debris. Measuring approximately 42 inches x 42 inches, the scarf can be worn in various ways. These versatile keffiyehs serve multiple purposes, such as slings, tourniquets, or pouches, making them essential for bug-out bags or 72-hour kits. Worn by military personnel worldwide, they're not only practical but also fashionable. Available in multiple colors.</p>",
